# What never needs to reach the deployment.
#
# Vercel has a 250 MB uncompressed limit per function, and this project carries
# a lot that the running app never reads. Keeping it out shortens uploads and
# leaves headroom for the dependencies that are genuinely needed.

# Raw 3D source assets — nothing in the app references them, and they are
# already out of git. public/models/*.glb is NOT listed: those are the
# compressed models the 3D building view loads, served straight from Vercel's
# CDN like the rest of public/ (not through the function, so they do not count
# against its size limit).
Meshy_AI_*/

# A standalone prototype with its own package.json, not mounted by app.js.
ccs-building-explorer/

# Database dumps. Real data, and never needed at runtime.
backups/

# Applied by hand against the database, not read by the app.
migrations/

# Arduino sources for the BLE scanners.
firmware/

# OCR language data: downloaded to the temp directory on first use instead.
eng.traineddata

# Working notes and documentation.
*.md
!README.md
facitrack_db.sql
facitrack_db_diagram.sql

# Local tooling
.playwright-cli/
.claude/
.vscode/
